{"id":"2d4a2f4663386b14","group":"58","path":"58/batch20/58-prop-beth-definability.md","title":"Beth Definability","display":"prop-beth-definability — Beth Definability","type":"proposition","metadata":{"type":"proposition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-prop-beth-definability","aliases":["58-prop-beth-definability"],"display":"prop-beth-definability — Beth Definability","depends_on":["[[58-df-language]]","[[58-df-theory]]","[[58-df-formula]]","[[58-df-satisfaction]]","[[../batch06/58-df-first-order-language.md]]","[[../batch18/58-df-structure.md]]","[[../batch09/58-df-model.md]]","[[../batch07/58-df-free-variable.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"proposition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-prop-beth-definability"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-prop-beth-definability</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"prop-beth-definability — Beth Definability"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d81b1b2123168018\" href=\"?note=d81b1b2123168018\" title=\"58-df-language\">58-df-language</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"90ce6acf0c65af45\" href=\"?note=90ce6acf0c65af45\" title=\"58-df-theory\">58-df-theory</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"58-df-formula\">58-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"8b6a90316aad78a4\" href=\"?note=8b6a90316aad78a4\" title=\"58-df-satisfaction\">58-df-satisfaction</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"3888033a846b1cd5\" href=\"?note=3888033a846b1cd5\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-first-order-language.md\">../batch06/58-df-first-order-language.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"d9b8711cda3f31ca\" href=\"?note=d9b8711cda3f31ca\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-structure.md\">../batch18/58-df-structure.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"923884eb8fe4e61d\" href=\"?note=923884eb8fe4e61d\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-model.md\">../batch09/58-df-model.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"715a32e91161b34f\" href=\"?note=715a32e91161b34f\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-free-variable.md\">../batch07/58-df-free-variable.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L,L_R,T,R,n,\\varphi,\\psi,\\mathcal M,\\mathcal N\\in V\">\\(L,L_R,T,R,n,\\varphi,\\psi,\\mathcal M,\\mathcal N\\in V\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\">\\(n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\)</span>。本书一阶语言的非逻辑关系符号具有正元数。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguage}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguage}_S\\)</span>、语言投影、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Struct}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Struct}_S\\)</span>、结构解释映射、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Model}_S(\\mathcal M,T,L)\">\\(\\mathrm{Model}_S(\\mathcal M,T,L)\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\models_L\">\\(\\models_L\\)</span> 取下列内部依赖的定义。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v_0,v_1,\\ldots\">\\(v_0,v_1,\\ldots\\)</span> 为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-formula.md\">../batch17/58-df-formula.md</a> 的不同变量码；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec v_n=\\{\\langle i,v_i\\rangle:i\\in n\\}\">\\(\\vec v_n=\\{\\langle i,v_i\\rangle:i\\in n\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R(\\vec v_n)\">\\(R(\\vec v_n)\\)</span> 表示该文件的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 元原子公式构造子。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall\\vec v_n\\,\\chi\">\\(\\forall\\vec v_n\\,\\chi\\)</span> 缩写为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q(n)\">\\(q(n)\\)</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(L_R)^{n+1}\">\\(q\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(L_R)^{n+1}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q(0)=\\chi\">\\(q(0)=\\chi\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall i\\in n\\;(q(i+1)=\\forall v_{n-1-i}\\,q(i))\">\\(\\forall i\\in n\\;(q(i+1)=\\forall v_{n-1-i}\\,q(i))\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AddedRelationLanguage}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{AddedRelationLanguage}_S\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LanguageInclusion}_{58}\">\\(\\mathrm{LanguageInclusion}_{58}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SameReduct}_{\\mathsf{meta}}\">\\(\\operatorname{SameReduct}_{\\mathsf{meta}}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SemanticConsequence}_{\\mathsf{meta}}\">\\(\\operatorname{SemanticConsequence}_{\\mathsf{meta}}\\)</span> 在下式定义。后两者保留原名称及参数顺序，均不以未解释的元语言关系为前提。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ImplicitlyDefines}_{\\mathsf{meta}}\">\\(\\operatorname{ImplicitlyDefines}_{\\mathsf{meta}}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ExplicitlyDefines}_{\\mathsf{meta}}\">\\(\\operatorname{ExplicitlyDefines}_{\\mathsf{meta}}\\)</span> 保留原四元、五元接口。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cst}\">\\(\\mathrm{Cst}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fun}\">\\(\\mathrm{Fun}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Symbols}\">\\(\\mathrm{Symbols}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"3888033a846b1cd5\" href=\"?note=3888033a846b1cd5\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-first-order-language.md\">../batch06/58-df-first-order-language.md</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Univ}\">\\(\\mathrm{Univ}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"d9b8711cda3f31ca\" href=\"?note=d9b8711cda3f31ca\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-structure.md\">../batch18/58-df-structure.md</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{cst}\">\\(\\mathrm{cst}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{fun}\">\\(\\mathrm{fun}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{rel}\">\\(\\mathrm{rel}\\)</span> 为本原子在下式引入、量化绑定或仅作层级/排版标签的记号；其参数次序与适用域由相应公式固定，不作为额外的未声明外部对象。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{LanguageInclusion}_{58}(L,L&#39;)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguage}_S(L)\\land\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguage}_S(L&#39;)\\land\nL.\\mathrm{Cst}\\subseteq L&#39;.\\mathrm{Cst}\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall k\\in\\omega\\;\\bigl(L.\\mathrm{Fun}_k\\subseteq L&#39;.\\mathrm{Fun}_k\\land\nL.\\mathrm{Rel}_k\\subseteq L&#39;.\\mathrm{Rel}_k\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{LanguageInclusion}_{58}(L,L&#39;)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguage}_S(L)\\land\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguage}_S(L&#39;)\\land\nL.\\mathrm{Cst}\\subseteq L&#39;.\\mathrm{Cst}\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall k\\in\\omega\\;\\bigl(L.\\mathrm{Fun}_k\\subseteq L&#39;.\\mathrm{Fun}_k\\land\nL.\\mathrm{Rel}_k\\subseteq L&#39;.\\mathrm{Rel}_k\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{AddedRelationLanguage}_S(L_R,L,R,n)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguage}_S(L)\\land n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\n\\land R\\notin\\mathrm{Symbols}_S(L)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists A,F,C,a\\in V\\;\\bigl(L=\\langle A,F,C,a\\rangle\\land\nL_R=\\langle A\\cup\\{R\\},F,C,a\\cup\\{\\langle R,n\\rangle\\}\\rangle\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{AddedRelationLanguage}_S(L_R,L,R,n)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguage}_S(L)\\land n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\n\\land R\\notin\\mathrm{Symbols}_S(L)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists A,F,C,a\\in V\\;\\bigl(L=\\langle A,F,C,a\\rangle\\land\nL_R=\\langle A\\cup\\{R\\},F,C,a\\cup\\{\\langle R,n\\rangle\\}\\rangle\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{SameReduct}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(\\mathcal M,\\mathcal N;L)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\exists L_1,L_2\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{LanguageInclusion}_{58}(L,L_1)\n\\land\\mathrm{LanguageInclusion}_{58}(L,L_2)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathcal M,L_1)\\land\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathcal N,L_2)\n\\land\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal M)=\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal N)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall c\\in L.\\mathrm{Cst}\\;I^{\\mathcal M}_{\\mathrm{cst}}(c)=I^{\\mathcal N}_{\\mathrm{cst}}(c)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall k\\in\\omega\\;\\Bigl[\n\\forall f\\in L.\\mathrm{Fun}_k\\;I^{\\mathcal M}_{\\mathrm{fun},k}(f)=I^{\\mathcal N}_{\\mathrm{fun},k}(f)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{31mm}\\land\\forall r\\in L.\\mathrm{Rel}_k\\;I^{\\mathcal M}_{\\mathrm{rel},k}(r)=I^{\\mathcal N}_{\\mathrm{rel},k}(r)\\Bigr]\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{SameReduct}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(\\mathcal M,\\mathcal N;L)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\exists L_1,L_2\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{LanguageInclusion}_{58}(L,L_1)\n\\land\\mathrm{LanguageInclusion}_{58}(L,L_2)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathcal M,L_1)\\land\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathcal N,L_2)\n\\land\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal M)=\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal N)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall c\\in L.\\mathrm{Cst}\\;I^{\\mathcal M}_{\\mathrm{cst}}(c)=I^{\\mathcal N}_{\\mathrm{cst}}(c)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall k\\in\\omega\\;\\Bigl[\n\\forall f\\in L.\\mathrm{Fun}_k\\;I^{\\mathcal M}_{\\mathrm{fun},k}(f)=I^{\\mathcal N}_{\\mathrm{fun},k}(f)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{31mm}\\land\\forall r\\in L.\\mathrm{Rel}_k\\;I^{\\mathcal M}_{\\mathrm{rel},k}(r)=I^{\\mathcal N}_{\\mathrm{rel},k}(r)\\Bigr]\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{SemanticConsequence}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(T,\\psi;L_R)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Theory}(T,L_R)\\land\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(L_R)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\mathcal M\\in V\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Model}_S(\\mathcal M,T,L_R)\\to\\mathcal M\\models_{L_R}\\psi\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{SemanticConsequence}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(T,\\psi;L_R)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Theory}(T,L_R)\\land\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(L_R)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\mathcal M\\in V\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Model}_S(\\mathcal M,T,L_R)\\to\\mathcal M\\models_{L_R}\\psi\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{ImplicitlyDefines}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(T,R;L,n)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\exists L_R\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{AddedRelationLanguage}_S(L_R,L,R,n)\\land\\mathrm{Theory}(T,L_R)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\mathcal M,\\mathcal N\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Model}_S(\\mathcal M,T,L_R)\\land\\mathrm{Model}_S(\\mathcal N,T,L_R)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\operatorname{SameReduct}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(\\mathcal M,\\mathcal N;L)\n\\to I^{\\mathcal M}_{\\mathrm{rel},n}(R)=I^{\\mathcal N}_{\\mathrm{rel},n}(R)\\Bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{ImplicitlyDefines}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(T,R;L,n)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\exists L_R\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{AddedRelationLanguage}_S(L_R,L,R,n)\\land\\mathrm{Theory}(T,L_R)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\mathcal M,\\mathcal N\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Model}_S(\\mathcal M,T,L_R)\\land\\mathrm{Model}_S(\\mathcal N,T,L_R)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\operatorname{SameReduct}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(\\mathcal M,\\mathcal N;L)\n\\to I^{\\mathcal M}_{\\mathrm{rel},n}(R)=I^{\\mathcal N}_{\\mathrm{rel},n}(R)\\Bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{ExplicitlyDefines}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(T,R,\\varphi;L,n)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\exists L_R\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{AddedRelationLanguage}_S(L_R,L,R,n)\\land\\mathrm{Theory}(T,L_R)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(L)\\land\\mathrm{FV}_L(\\varphi)\\subseteq\\{v_i:i\\in n\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\operatorname{SemanticConsequence}_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n(T,\\forall\\vec v_n\\,(R(\\vec v_n)\\leftrightarrow\\varphi);L_R)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{ExplicitlyDefines}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(T,R,\\varphi;L,n)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\exists L_R\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{AddedRelationLanguage}_S(L_R,L,R,n)\\land\\mathrm{Theory}(T,L_R)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(L)\\land\\mathrm{FV}_L(\\varphi)\\subseteq\\{v_i:i\\in n\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\operatorname{SemanticConsequence}_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n(T,\\forall\\vec v_n\\,(R(\\vec v_n)\\leftrightarrow\\varphi);L_R)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}beth\\text{-}definability}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{ImplicitlyDefines}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(T,R;L,n)\n\\to\\exists\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(L)\\;\n\\operatorname{ExplicitlyDefines}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(T,R,\\varphi;L,n).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}beth\\text{-}definability}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{ImplicitlyDefines}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(T,R;L,n)\n\\to\\exists\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(L)\\;\n\\operatorname{ExplicitlyDefines}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(T,R,\\varphi;L,n).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>语言是四分量签名，不再用集合并 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\\cup\\{R\\}\">\\(L\\cup\\{R\\}\\)</span> 冒充签名扩张。隐式定义仍表示同一约化上的解释唯一性，显式定义仍表示由原语言公式定义；结论没有弱化为条件化的占位命题。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-language","status":"resolved","id":"d81b1b2123168018","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-language]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-theory","status":"resolved","id":"90ce6acf0c65af45","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-theory]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"65418b505fc53093","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-satisfaction","status":"resolved","id":"8b6a90316aad78a4","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-satisfaction]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch06/58-df-first-order-language.md","status":"resolved","id":"3888033a846b1cd5","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-df-first-order-language.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-structure.md","status":"resolved","id":"d9b8711cda3f31ca","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-structure.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch09/58-df-model.md","status":"resolved","id":"923884eb8fe4e61d","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-df-model.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-free-variable.md","status":"resolved","id":"715a32e91161b34f","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-free-variable.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-formula.md","status":"resolved","id":"65418b505fc53093","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$v_0,v_1,\\ldots$ 为 [[../batch17/58-df-formula.md]] 的不同变量码；$\\vec v_n=\\{\\langle i,v_i\\rangle:i\\in n\\}$，$R(\\vec v_n)$ 表示该文件的 $n$ 元原子公式构造子。","embed":false},{"target":"../batch06/58-df-first-order-language.md","status":"resolved","id":"3888033a846b1cd5","anchor":"ref-10","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"外部接口 $\\mathrm{Cst}$、$\\mathrm{Fun}$、$\\mathrm{Symbols}$ 取 [[../batch06/58-df-first-order-language.md]] 的同名定义与参数次序。","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-structure.md","status":"resolved","id":"d9b8711cda3f31ca","anchor":"ref-11","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"外部接口 $\\mathrm{Univ}$ 取 [[../batch18/58-df-structure.md]] 的同名定义与参数次序。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"L,L_R,T,R,n,\\varphi,\\psi,\\mathcal M,\\mathcal N\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguage}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Struct}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Model}_S(\\mathcal M,T,L)","display":false},{"tex":"\\models_L","display":false},{"tex":"v_0,v_1,\\ldots","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec v_n=\\{\\langle i,v_i\\rangle:i\\in n\\}","display":false},{"tex":"R(\\vec v_n)","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall\\vec v_n\\,\\chi","display":false},{"tex":"q(n)","display":false},{"tex":"q\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(L_R)^{n+1}","display":false},{"tex":"q(0)=\\chi","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall i\\in n\\;(q(i+1)=\\forall v_{n-1-i}\\,q(i))","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{AddedRelationLanguage}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{LanguageInclusion}_{58}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{SameReduct}_{\\mathsf{meta}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{SemanticConsequence}_{\\mathsf{meta}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ImplicitlyDefines}_{\\mathsf{meta}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ExplicitlyDefines}_{\\mathsf{meta}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cst}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Fun}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Symbols}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Univ}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{cst}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{fun}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{rel}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{LanguageInclusion}_{58}(L,L')\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguage}_S(L)\\land\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguage}_S(L')\\land\nL.\\mathrm{Cst}\\subseteq L'.\\mathrm{Cst}\\\\\n&\\land\\forall k\\in\\omega\\;\\bigl(L.\\mathrm{Fun}_k\\subseteq L'.\\mathrm{Fun}_k\\land\nL.\\mathrm{Rel}_k\\subseteq L'.\\mathrm{Rel}_k\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{AddedRelationLanguage}_S(L_R,L,R,n)\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguage}_S(L)\\land n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\n\\land R\\notin\\mathrm{Symbols}_S(L)\\\\\n&\\land\\exists A,F,C,a\\in V\\;\\bigl(L=\\langle A,F,C,a\\rangle\\land\nL_R=\\langle A\\cup\\{R\\},F,C,a\\cup\\{\\langle R,n\\rangle\\}\\rangle\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{SameReduct}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(\\mathcal M,\\mathcal N;L)\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\exists L_1,L_2\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{LanguageInclusion}_{58}(L,L_1)\n\\land\\mathrm{LanguageInclusion}_{58}(L,L_2)\\\\\n&\\land\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathcal M,L_1)\\land\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathcal N,L_2)\n\\land\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal M)=\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal N)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall c\\in L.\\mathrm{Cst}\\;I^{\\mathcal M}_{\\mathrm{cst}}(c)=I^{\\mathcal N}_{\\mathrm{cst}}(c)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall k\\in\\omega\\;\\Bigl[\n\\forall f\\in L.\\mathrm{Fun}_k\\;I^{\\mathcal M}_{\\mathrm{fun},k}(f)=I^{\\mathcal N}_{\\mathrm{fun},k}(f)\\\\\n&\\hspace{31mm}\\land\\forall r\\in L.\\mathrm{Rel}_k\\;I^{\\mathcal M}_{\\mathrm{rel},k}(r)=I^{\\mathcal N}_{\\mathrm{rel},k}(r)\\Bigr]\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{SemanticConsequence}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(T,\\psi;L_R)\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathrm{Theory}(T,L_R)\\land\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(L_R)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall\\mathcal M\\in V\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Model}_S(\\mathcal M,T,L_R)\\to\\mathcal M\\models_{L_R}\\psi\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{ImplicitlyDefines}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(T,R;L,n)\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\exists L_R\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{AddedRelationLanguage}_S(L_R,L,R,n)\\land\\mathrm{Theory}(T,L_R)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall\\mathcal M,\\mathcal N\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Model}_S(\\mathcal M,T,L_R)\\land\\mathrm{Model}_S(\\mathcal N,T,L_R)\\\\\n&\\quad\\land\\operatorname{SameReduct}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(\\mathcal M,\\mathcal N;L)\n\\to I^{\\mathcal M}_{\\mathrm{rel},n}(R)=I^{\\mathcal N}_{\\mathrm{rel},n}(R)\\Bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{ExplicitlyDefines}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(T,R,\\varphi;L,n)\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\exists L_R\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{AddedRelationLanguage}_S(L_R,L,R,n)\\land\\mathrm{Theory}(T,L_R)\\\\\n&\\land\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(L)\\land\\mathrm{FV}_L(\\varphi)\\subseteq\\{v_i:i\\in n\\}\\\\\n&\\land\\operatorname{SemanticConsequence}_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n(T,\\forall\\vec v_n\\,(R(\\vec v_n)\\leftrightarrow\\varphi);L_R)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}beth\\text{-}definability}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{ImplicitlyDefines}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(T,R;L,n)\n\\to\\exists\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(L)\\;\n\\operatorname{ExplicitlyDefines}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(T,R,\\varphi;L,n).","display":true},{"tex":"L\\cup\\{R\\}","display":false}],"bytes":5206,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3934","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch20/58-prop-beth-definability.md|58-prop-beth-definability]]（batch20）"}],"outgoing":["d81b1b2123168018","90ce6acf0c65af45","65418b505fc53093","8b6a90316aad78a4","3888033a846b1cd5","d9b8711cda3f31ca","923884eb8fe4e61d","715a32e91161b34f"]}